 "description": "Checks records for the Annexure B JSON (statement of inward-supply invoices) for a GST refund of accumulated ITC (RFD-01), the file the GST portal otherwise requires from its Excel offline utility. Applies the offline utility's own checks and returns every error and warning at once, with its row and field. Free; needs no sign-in; stores nothing. A file made by the official utility can be passed as data unchanged. ITC eligibility, reversal amounts and GSTR-2B periods come from the taxpayer's reviewed records; the tool does not infer them.",
